  "prefLabel": "Puc 2502.40 Year",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 2502.40 “Year” means “year” as defined in RSA 362-F:2, XVI, namely “a calendar year beginning January 1 and ending December 31.”\n\nSource. #10741, eff 12-5-14; ss by #12473, eff 2-1-18 (formerly Puc 2502.38)",
